    "timeoutMs": 90000,
    "model": "minicpm-v",
    "prompt": "Look closely at this cropped screenshot. If there's readable text (a paper, article, code, etc), respond in Chinese with one specific, useful thought about what it says. If the text is too small, blurry, or dense for you to actually make out what it's about, say so honestly in one short Chinese sentence (e.g. \"这像是一段密集的文字，但看不清具体讲什么\") instead of guessing a specific topic you can't actually verify -- an honest guess is fine, a confident wrong answer is worse than no answer. If there's no text at all, or it's a photo/UI/image, describe in Chinese in one short sentence what you actually see. Never claim the image is completely empty, never ask for a different image."
  },
